Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.55,0:01:17.25,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Que quase consumiu os nossos corações
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.75,0:01:23.80,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Você ainda encontrou a coragem para sorrir
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.05,0:01:28.60,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Como se aceitasse tudo aquilo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.40,0:01:31.86,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Eu perdi a minha voz
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.06,0:01:34.48,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}E as palavras que queria dizer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.76,0:01:39.73,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Mas a cada vez que caía de joelhos
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.08,0:01:44.03,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Eu me levantava e continuava a caminhar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.30,0:01:49.70,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Estávamos buscando o futuro branco ideal
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.91,0:01:54.93,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}A nossa única esperança
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.26,0:01:57.42,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Agora posso ter ficado sem nada
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.59,0:02:02.84,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,0)\blur7.5}A não ser estas emoções ardentes que
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.90,0:02:05.94,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,380)\blur7.5}Não têm para onde ir
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.19,0:02:11.19,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Ainda assim, buscarei um novo amanhecer
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.57,0:02:14.60,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Com mais de uma resposta certa
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.84,0:02:18.43,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,0)\blur7.5}Não vou parar
